WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.153
Ricci flow and scalar curvature.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.127
The flow stops only when curvature blows up.

3
00:00:05.127 --> 00:00:07.163
Is the scalar part enough to watch?

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.070
A blow-up with bounded scalar curvature needs

5
00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:13.016
a bubble; four dimensions forbids it.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.842
Claimed: yes in four, no in high dimensions.

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.544
Not in Lean.
